1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 26=

2
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,980
So you admit it.

3
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:14,580
You're the one behind
Long Feng and Lv Mengde.

4
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,780
For the sake of
tonight's grand spectacle,

5
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:18,220
how many lives have you taken?

6
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:19,540
What are you really trying to achieve?

7
00:01:26,220 --> 00:01:27,220
The same thing as you.

8
00:01:28,420 --> 00:01:29,900
Revenge for my family.

9
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:31,540
Revenge?

10
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:36,580
Ren Zuifa was originally
just my father's driver.

11
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:38,900
He secretly colluded with the Japanese,

12
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,780
seized my family's businesses,

13
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,500
and used gang rivalries

14
00:01:42,740 --> 00:01:43,940
to wipe out my entire family.

15
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:45,900
Kun Society's fortune

16
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,820
was built on my family's blood,

17
00:01:49,220 --> 00:01:51,100
one step at a time.

18
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,020
Tell me.

19
00:01:53,060 --> 00:01:53,980
Don't they deserve to die?

20
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:55,420
So you used those girls

21
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:56,980
to lure the bosses of Kun Society,

22
00:01:57,340 --> 00:01:58,820
whetting their appetites

23
00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:01,300
before gathering them
all aboard this ship

24
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,260
to wipe them out in one fell swoop.

25
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:03,260
Miss Mei.

26
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:05,780
It's a shame you aren't a detective.

27
00:02:05,940 --> 00:02:07,300
That was exactly my plan.

28
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,300
What about Xiaozhu?

29
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:10,500
Was she part of your plan too?

30
00:02:10,940 --> 00:02:11,860
I swear,

31
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:13,660
I never meant to hurt her.

32
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,740
I genuinely admired her.

33
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:17,620
If she hadn't insisted
on standing up for others

34
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:20,780
and crossed paths with Lv Mengde
as he was desperate to rise,

35
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:22,660
how could things have
gone so terribly wrong

36
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:23,860
and led to that accident?

37
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,660
Fortunately, something good came of it.

38
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:28,420
I'd been searching everywhere

39
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:30,420
for the older sister who took the list,

40
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,820
wondering how to clean up
Lv Mengde's mess.

41
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:35,340
Then you appeared.

42
00:02:37,170 --> 00:02:38,180
You

43
00:02:38,620 --> 00:02:39,700
made me realize

44
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:42,500
I could do more than kill
the people of Kun Society.

45
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,220
I could also use public opinion

46
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:46,420
to ruin their reputations.

47
00:02:46,980 --> 00:02:47,780
You...

48
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:53,780
Miss Mei.

49
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:01,860
Miss Mei.

50
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:03,980
I always thought we were alike.

51
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:05,700
Both orphans.

52
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:07,700
Both people
who survived against all odds

53
00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:09,180
and struggled to stay alive.

54
00:03:09,220 --> 00:03:10,620
I could accept it if
you didn't understand me.

55
00:03:11,220 --> 00:03:12,820
But why would you help our enemies?

56
00:03:13,540 --> 00:03:14,380
Miss Mei.

57
00:03:14,660 --> 00:03:16,060
You've really disappointed me.

58
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:18,060
I'm the one who should be disappointed.

59
00:03:18,820 --> 00:03:19,740
Fanshu.

60
00:03:20,060 --> 00:03:22,060
I've never held anything against you.

61
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:24,220
Ever since you returned from Nanyang,

62
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:25,660
everything I've done to look after you

63
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:29,100
has been completely sincere.

64
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:31,660
Can't you let go of the past

65
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:34,540
and move on with your life?

66
00:03:34,620 --> 00:03:35,420
Look after me?

67
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:40,740
If I killed your entire family

68
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:41,980
and made you call me Father,

69
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:43,780
would you let go of your hatred

70
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:45,220
and move on?

71
00:03:45,220 --> 00:03:46,340
Stop!

72
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:48,420
Nobody move!

73
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:52,260
Ding Zhao, so you really are alive.

74
00:03:52,900 --> 00:03:54,820
Ding Zhao, you've come
at just the right time.

75
00:03:54,900 --> 00:03:56,860
Quick. Kill him and avenge your family.

76
00:03:57,140 --> 00:03:59,060
He's the real mastermind
behind the cat training.

77
00:03:59,060 --> 00:04:00,780
He's the one responsible
for your sister's death!

78
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:02,020
Jing Fanshu.

79
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:05,380
Ding Yiyi was killed
by Kuang Jinpeng and Lv Mengde.

80
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:07,300
I'm simply carrying out my own justice.

81
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,460
Your justice?

82
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:09,980
You know perfectly well

83
00:04:09,980 --> 00:04:11,100
what terrible things
Kun Society has done.

84
00:04:11,620 --> 00:04:12,940
I'm purging Kun Society

85
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:14,100
to restore peace
and justice to Shanghai.

86
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:15,220
What's wrong with that?

87
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:17,160
Every one of my men

88
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:17,820
has had their family destroyed

89
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:19,620
by Kun Society's oppression.

90
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:20,860
And your idea of justice

91
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:22,500
is to harm those girls?

92
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:24,580
With or without me,

93
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:26,140
those beautiful girls
from the lowest ranks of society

94
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:27,580
were doomed to die.

95
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:29,300
Traffickers abduct people,

96
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:30,900
and the powerful prey on young women.

97
00:04:31,020 --> 00:04:32,780
It's been that way throughout history.

98
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,420
I merely took advantage of it.

99
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:35,620
If you want someone to blame,

100
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:37,940
blame these bosses of Kun Society.

101
00:04:38,140 --> 00:04:40,260
Their greed and lust

102
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:41,860
are what started all of this.

103
00:04:41,940 --> 00:04:42,940
They're the real villains.

104
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:43,780
Jing Fanshu.

105
00:04:44,460 --> 00:04:46,620
I don't care how you turn on each other.

106
00:04:47,020 --> 00:04:47,620
But

107
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:50,460
you caused the deaths
of Yiyi, Mei Xiaozhu,

108
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:52,460
and so many innocent people.

109
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:54,180
I'll never let you get away with it.

110
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:56,860
Ding Zhao, I suggest you calm down.

111
00:04:57,220 --> 00:04:58,260
Killing me

112
00:04:58,460 --> 00:04:59,700
won't do you any good.

113
00:05:00,620 --> 00:05:01,420
But

114
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,860
if you kill Boss Ren,

115
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:06,300
I'll let you and Mei Yuhe leave.

116
00:05:06,540 --> 00:05:07,340
Ding Zhao.

117
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:08,500
Don't listen to his nonsense.

118
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:09,860
Kill him.

119
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:11,420
I'll give you wealth and luxury!

120
00:05:12,620 --> 00:05:13,980
Save your breath.

121
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:16,700
The entire ship is
packed with explosives.

122
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:19,820
There's no way you're
getting off this ship.

123
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:21,420
Explosives?

124
00:05:23,060 --> 00:05:24,380
That thing you touched earlier,

125
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:25,140
what was it?

126
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:26,100
Black powder.

127
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:27,300
Are you saying

128
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:29,420
that black powder belongs to you?

129
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:31,900
But this ship is full of children
from the Cishan Foundation.

130
00:05:31,900 --> 00:05:33,500
Are you going to blow them up too?

131
00:05:33,660 --> 00:05:35,180
Will Boss Ren be the only one to die,

132
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:37,420
or will all of us die together?

133
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:39,020
Ding Zhao.

134
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:42,300
The choice is yours.

135
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,020
If I die, she dies too.

136
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:53,020
Ding Zhao, kill me.

137
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:53,900
Mei Yuhe.

138
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:56,620
Jing Fanshu.

139
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:58,700
I want you to keep your promise.

140
00:05:58,900 --> 00:05:59,820
Spare the children.

141
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:00,980
Spare everyone.

142
00:06:01,700 --> 00:06:02,500
Miss Mei.

143
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:04,340
We take different paths
toward the same goal.

144
00:06:04,620 --> 00:06:05,660
I give you my word.

145
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:07,020
Ding Zhao, do it.

146
00:06:07,180 --> 00:06:07,980
Yuhe.

147
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:09,220
Do it!

148
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:14,460
Do it now!

149
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:19,460
Yuhe!

150
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:21,540
There's a difference between
justice and your idea of justice.

151
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:28,180
Mei Yuhe!

152
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,820
(Why?)

153
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:40,740
(Why can't you understand me?)

154
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:47,020
(It seems)

155
00:06:47,860 --> 00:06:49,580
(we were never truly on the same side.)

156
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:51,580
(Our paths may differ,)

157
00:06:52,980 --> 00:06:54,240
(but they'll never lead
to the same destination.)

158
00:07:05,420 --> 00:07:06,700
You think dying together

159
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:07,820
will save anyone?

160
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:09,220
Bai Mali is still up there.

161
00:07:09,740 --> 00:07:11,180
Those children are still up there.

162
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:12,460
What's going to happen to them?

163
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:14,460
Don't you want to save them anymore?

164
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:15,220
I do!

165
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:20,580
(Sir.)

166
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:22,820
(The task you entrusted to me,
I'll see it through.)

167
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:46,620
Let's go!

168
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:54,820
Make way!

169
00:07:55,820 --> 00:07:57,220
Open the door!

170
00:08:38,220 --> 00:08:39,020
(Madam.)

171
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:40,900
(There's something)

172
00:08:41,420 --> 00:08:43,060
(I don't want Dr. Bai to know)

173
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:45,300
(until I've confirmed it.)

174
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:47,140
(I have a feeling Long Feng)

175
00:08:47,140 --> 00:08:48,900
(never truly sided with Boss Ren.)

176
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,500
(I'm afraid the cat training)

177
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:53,620
(at this cruise party is just a cover.)

178
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:57,380
(They may have something else in mind.)

179
00:08:58,220 --> 00:09:00,100
(It could even put)

180
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:01,740
(many innocent lives at risk.)

181
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:03,460
(There's someone else)

182
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:05,020
(who's always seemed suspicious.)

183
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:07,220
(I need to go aboard
and investigate myself.)

184
00:09:08,420 --> 00:09:09,820
(For Xiaozhu and Yijie's sake,)

185
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:11,580
(and their courage
in exposing the truth,)

186
00:09:12,090 --> 00:09:14,260
- (I'd like you to hire some boats.)
- Please help me rescue the people aboard.

187
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:15,940
- (Have them support us from the shore.)
- For every person you save,

188
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:16,820
I'll pay you 100 fabi.
[*Fabi: China's currency at the time]

189
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:18,460
(If something happens
to the cruise ship...)

190
00:09:18,460 --> 00:09:19,220
I promise I'll pay!

191
00:09:19,220 --> 00:09:21,700
- (They might help us save some lives.)
- Me.

192
00:09:22,300 --> 00:09:22,850
Thank you.

193
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:24,260
Thank you.

194
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:25,380
Thank you.

195
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:36,580
Boss Ren is dead.

196
00:09:37,220 --> 00:09:38,820
Kun Society will soon cease to exist.

197
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:40,620
Are you still going
to stay here and wait to die?

198
00:09:40,620 --> 00:09:41,820
We've waited so long for this day.

199
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:43,380
We never expected to survive.

200
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:44,620
We've avenged our families.

201
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:45,940
We have no regrets.

202
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:47,740
You think killing those people

203
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,780
means you've achieved your revenge?

204
00:09:49,860 --> 00:09:50,820
Kun Society may be gone,

205
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:52,580
but other organizations
will still prey on people.

206
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:55,220
What did those women
and children you exploited

207
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:56,340
ever do wrong

208
00:09:56,420 --> 00:09:58,220
to pay the price for your revenge?

209
00:09:58,420 --> 00:09:59,500
Mr. Jing told us

210
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:01,060
that in times like these,

211
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:03,460
even if those children
stayed in Shanghai,

212
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:04,980
they wouldn't survive.

213
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:06,820
They might as well die
for a worthy cause

214
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:08,260
and make their deaths mean something.

215
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:10,380
You're not those children.

216
00:10:10,820 --> 00:10:12,540
How do you know they can't survive?

217
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:15,700
How do you know Shanghai can't change?

218
00:10:22,620 --> 00:10:23,420
Look.

219
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:25,120
There are boats!

220
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,820
People have come to rescue us!

221
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,340
Do you see?

222
00:10:30,700 --> 00:10:32,300
The people on shore
haven't given up on us.

223
00:10:32,300 --> 00:10:33,380
They've come to save us.

224
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:35,540
Are you really going
to give up on yourselves?

225
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:38,140
Wake up! All of you!

226
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:41,260
Are we just going to wait here to die?

227
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:44,140
My sister died

228
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:45,700
trying to expose these atrocities.

229
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:47,940
My best friend,

230
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:49,980
reporter Yan Qing, died too.

231
00:10:50,260 --> 00:10:51,180
Do you really think

232
00:10:51,180 --> 00:10:52,820
dying here in some grand sacrifice

233
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:54,020
makes you heroes?

234
00:10:54,180 --> 00:10:55,340
You're wrong.

235
00:10:56,020 --> 00:10:58,580
That would be the greatest
betrayal of those who died!

236
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,060
What our departed loved ones

237
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:02,980
would want most

238
00:11:03,660 --> 00:11:05,460
is for us to stay alive and live well.

239
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:10,100
If you have even a shred
of conscience left,

240
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:12,620
even a little compassion,

241
00:11:13,940 --> 00:11:15,100
then choose to live!

242
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:17,220
Come with me and save the others!

243
00:11:22,860 --> 00:11:24,100
Don't panic!

244
00:11:24,900 --> 00:11:25,940
Run this way!

245
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:28,580
This way!

246
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:29,700
Over here!

247
00:11:30,140 --> 00:11:30,940
This way!

248
00:11:34,020 --> 00:11:37,060
♪Like blades cutting through the light♪

249
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:38,020
It's all right now.

250
00:11:38,020 --> 00:11:38,860
I'm here.

251
00:11:39,140 --> 00:11:40,220
I found you.

252
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:41,260
Yuhe.

253
00:11:43,020 --> 00:11:44,740
It's okay. Come on out.

254
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:49,770
♪Yet their eyes have
long since lost focus♪

255
00:11:50,010 --> 00:11:53,180
♪The city still shines♪

256
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:56,720
♪But it doesn't belong to me♪

257
00:11:56,890 --> 00:12:00,310
♪I choose to wait♪

258
00:12:00,310 --> 00:12:04,130
♪I choose to fall♪

259
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:06,110
♪They taught me to bow my head♪

260
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:08,120
♪To be beautiful, to be small♪

261
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:11,610
♪Growing within every crack♪

262
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:13,250
♪Even if I fall♪

263
00:12:13,260 --> 00:12:15,210
♪I will fall with my eyes wide open♪

264
00:12:15,220 --> 00:12:16,810
♪Never numb♪

265
00:12:17,660 --> 00:12:19,540
Look! The ship is back!

266
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:21,260
They're back.

267
00:12:21,260 --> 00:12:21,820
They're saved.

268
00:12:22,300 --> 00:12:23,020
Look!

269
00:12:23,020 --> 00:12:25,140
Those really are
the bosses of Kun Society!

270
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:27,500
It's Director Kong,
Bank President Qin, and the others!

271
00:12:28,420 --> 00:12:29,660
Did you abuse women

272
00:12:29,660 --> 00:12:30,860
on the cruise ship again?

273
00:12:30,860 --> 00:12:32,460
Don't you have mothers
and daughters of your own?

274
00:12:32,460 --> 00:12:34,460
- How could you do something so monstrous?
- Stop making accusations!

275
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:36,260
Move aside!

276
00:12:36,260 --> 00:12:37,420
Look! These children

277
00:12:37,530 --> 00:12:39,340
are living proof
of Kun Society's crimes!

278
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:40,620
You can't leave!

279
00:12:41,300 --> 00:12:43,540
Miss Mei!

280
00:12:43,660 --> 00:12:44,340
Mr. Ding!

281
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:44,840
Mrs. Kuang!

282
00:12:44,850 --> 00:12:45,720
Are you all right?

283
00:12:50,580 --> 00:12:53,420
Miss Mei, you did it.

284
00:12:54,340 --> 00:12:55,420
You did too.

285
00:13:04,180 --> 00:13:06,380
If Xiaozhu and Yijie were still alive,

286
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:10,740
they'd be so happy to see this.

287
00:13:26,300 --> 00:13:27,540
They saw it.

288
00:13:32,180 --> 00:13:33,100
Where's Dr. Bai?

289
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:35,180
Is Dr. Bai all right?

290
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:42,530
Don't worry.

291
00:13:43,860 --> 00:13:45,460
I'll take you back to Nanyang.

292
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:51,060
Give her some time.

293
00:13:52,740 --> 00:13:54,660
Let her come to terms with everything.

294
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:06,440
(Six Months Later.
Mei Yuhe Detective Agency)

295
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:10,460
Mei Yuhe Detective Agency.

296
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:13,060
You're giving up tailoring
to become a detective?

297
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:14,380
Have you really thought this through?

298
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:16,980
Yes. Shanghai needs detectives.

299
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:20,420
In those dark corners we never see,

300
00:15:20,910 --> 00:15:22,540
there must be even more crimes.

301
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:24,460
The cases the police won't investigate,

302
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:25,420
I'll take them on.

303
00:15:25,780 --> 00:15:26,460
Good.

304
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:29,900
But tell me,

305
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:32,660
if Dr. Bai and Mrs. Kuang

306
00:15:32,660 --> 00:15:34,220
find out I've changed careers,

307
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:35,740
do you think they'll laugh at me?

308
00:15:36,060 --> 00:15:37,900
Send them a telegram and ask.

309
00:15:41,610 --> 00:15:44,660
I wonder if Dr. Bai is still in Nanyang.

310
00:15:45,180 --> 00:15:48,420
And whether Mrs. Kuang has settled
into life in Hong Kong, China.

311
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:51,260
What about you?

312
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:52,180
What are your plans?

313
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:53,260
Me?

314
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:57,420
I've spent my whole life
chasing down debts.

315
00:15:57,980 --> 00:15:59,100
Now that you've suddenly asked,

316
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:00,380
I'm a little lost.

317
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:01,820
How about this?

318
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:04,740
You teach me
your family's tailoring skills,

319
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:06,940
and I'll open a tailor shop next door.

320
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:07,700
What do you think?

321
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,210
You, a tailor?

322
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:11,060
Forget it.

323
00:16:11,060 --> 00:16:12,420
Why not keep working with me

324
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:13,690
as my detective partner?

325
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:15,800
It's a deal!

326
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:18,700
Yuhe.

327
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:20,280
The verdict is in. The court has ruled.

328
00:16:24,010 --> 00:16:24,680
(The Black Cat Girls Finally Get Justice)

329
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:25,700
(The Monstrous Bosses Sent to Prison)
Finally.

330
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:27,320
(Mei Yuhe Detective Agency)
That's wonderful.

331
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:28,220
A good omen.

332
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:30,340
Two reasons to celebrate.

333
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:31,860
I'll go set off some firecrackers

334
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:32,860
to celebrate!

335
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:34,580
Yuhe.

336
00:16:34,660 --> 00:16:35,900
Now that you're going to be detectives,

337
00:16:35,900 --> 00:16:36,980
what should I do?

338
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:40,980
You should go to school
and learn to read.

339
00:16:41,380 --> 00:16:42,300
When you grow up,

340
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:43,940
you can be whatever you want.

341
00:16:44,340 --> 00:16:47,010
♪I want my fingers to be sharp♪

342
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:51,650
♪My steps to avoid the thorns♪

343
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:54,850
♪I want to wake and look at you♪

344
00:16:54,860 --> 00:16:59,880
♪With eyes no longer clouded♪

345
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,120
♪Those who hurt me♪

346
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:02,690
♪I choose to pierce through♪

347
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:04,410
♪I choose to tear apart♪

348
00:17:04,420 --> 00:17:07,100
♪I choose to light up the city♪

349
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:08,410
♪I bow to no gods♪

350
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:10,010
♪I kneel to no authority♪

351
00:17:10,010 --> 00:17:13,850
♪No longer lost in sorrow♪

352
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:21,700
♪I will stand and carve my own destiny♪

353
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:27,320
♪The rainy night drags on,
and you never come home♪

354
00:17:28,890 --> 00:17:34,410
♪A black cat stands
outside the window, watching silently♪

355
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:42,440
♪I will set your courage ablaze♪

356
00:17:42,450 --> 00:17:51,120
♪Until hope burns anew
in every part of me♪

357
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:54,360
♪They sew a veil to hide their crimes♪

358
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:55,480
♪And say to me♪

359
00:17:55,490 --> 00:17:58,690
♪Give up. Don't ask why♪

360
00:17:58,690 --> 00:18:01,400
♪But I can feel your wounds♪

361
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:09,530
♪Hidden beneath the folds
of a rose-colored silk dress♪

362
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:11,970
♪I once witnessed an angel♪

363
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:16,980
♪Whose wings were broken amid applause♪

364
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:21,340
♪If this is what they call salvation♪

365
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:27,280
♪Then I'd rather light♪

366
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:30,640
♪A single city lamp♪

367
00:18:30,650 --> 00:18:39,140
♪Like a blade cutting
through the darkness♪

368
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:43,500
♪When all the glitter collapses♪

369
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:46,600
♪The truth remains♪

370
00:18:46,600 --> 00:19:01,690
♪And the sun will still shine as always♪
